WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.722
Why now, and why this approach?

00:00:04.802 --> 00:00:09.525
Large vision-language models have shown they can
fuse images and text and follow step-by-step reasoning,

00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:14.327
and prior research shows that adding a reasoning
process makes language models stronger.

00:00:14.407 --> 00:00:19.130
Meanwhile,

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:23.932
a huge untapped resource exists: communities behind
geo-localization games have spent

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:28.735
years assembling textual clues that pinpoint
countries and cities from subtle visual details.

00:00:28.815 --> 00:00:33.537
GeoReasoner's insight is to harvest that human
inference knowledge and pair it with high-quality street views,

00:00:33.617 --> 00:00:38.340
so the model learns not just to guess a location
but to justify it.
